sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant FE as React Frontend
    participant API as FastAPI Backend
    participant P as Parser / Shot Logic
    participant G as Generation Adapter
    participant V as Video Model/API

    U->>FE: Paste script
    FE->>API: Send script for parsing
    API->>P: Parse script into scenes
    P-->>API: Return scene objects
    API-->>FE: Display scenes

    U->>FE: Select scene
    FE->>API: Request shot suggestions
    API->>P: Generate shots for scene
    P-->>API: Return shot list
    API-->>FE: Display shots

    U->>FE: Select shot + camera controls
    FE->>API: Submit generation request
    API->>G: Build model-ready request
    G->>V: Send request to generation provider
    V-->>G: Return output/status
    G-->>API: Return generated video data
    API-->>FE: Display preview
